Scheme name:
gdsi

Status:
Provisional

Applications/protocols that use this scheme name:
A gdsi URI is a domain-free identifier (no host, no "//") that names a stable identity, 
unique within its namespace. Its structure and semantics are defined by the specification 
(in preparation). Any gdsi URI shown in referenced material is a non-normative example only.

